# Project data policy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The raw per-ticker download cache is NOT versioned (it is reproducible by
# running `python -m prisk.pipeline fetch`). The consolidated price panel in
# data/processed IS versioned so that every published number can be rebuilt
# exactly, even if a vendor revises history.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/raw/prices_snapshot.csv
